notes.notes:
This long-released game has received major improvements!
1. Added Russian language;
2. Significantly increased rewards for the successful completion of the level;
3. Increased damage from mouse clicks on enemies;
4. Increased reward from gold mining in the mine;
5. Achievements are now issued immediately when all conditions are met (previously it was issued upon exiting the game);
6. Removed the delay between waves of enemies! Now you don't have to waste your time waiting!
7. Added cheat code "laush" to the game to add money. You need to print it in the improvement store;
8. The game development environment has been updated to a more recent version.
